{
  "id": "multi-agent-coding-async-ttl-cache-review-loop-claude",
  "name": "多 Claude 循环审查编码示例 - AsyncTTLCache 小库实现",
  "graph_type": "control_flow",
  "default_join": "all",
  "max_total_visits": 18,
  "input": {
    "task": "请实现一个可复用的 Python 小库 `maos_cache.py`，提供一个生产可用的 `AsyncTTLCache` 与装饰器能力。要求：1. 支持同步函数和异步函数的缓存装饰器；2. 支持 TTL 过期、maxsize LRU 淘汰、手动 clear/invalidate；3. 对同一个 key 的并发异步调用要做 single-flight 去重，避免重复执行底层函数；4. 异常结果不能被缓存；5. 提供 cache_info 统计：hits、misses、evictions、inflight、size；6. 使用标准库实现，不依赖第三方库；7. 给出完整代码、pytest 风格测试代码、关键设计说明和使用示例。"
  },
  "start": "requirements_architect",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "requirements_architect",
      "label": "需求澄清与接口设计",
      "operation": "agent_task",
      "max_visits": 1,
      "agent": {
        "backend": "claude",
        "agent_key": "architect",
        "context_policy": "provided_context_only",
        "runtime_profile": "claude_print",
        "execution_mode": "claude_print",
        "poll_seconds": 30,
        "timeout_seconds": 1800,
        "artifact_transfer_mode": "inline",
        "result_text_limit": 9000,
        "prompt_payload_limit": 22000,
        "bare": true,
        "prompt": "你是 Python 库架构师。请把原始编码任务拆成明确规格，输出结构化 Markdown：公共 API、类/函数签名、关键数据结构、TTL 与 LRU 的交互规则、同步/异步装饰器行为、并发 single-flight 语义、异常处理、cache_info 统计定义、测试验收清单。不要写完整实现代码，但可以给出伪代码。"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 2100
    },
    {
      "id": "core_implementation",
      "label": "核心实现编码与修订",
      "operation": "agent_task",
      "join": "any",
      "max_visits": 3,
      "deps": [
        "requirements_architect",
        "quality_review_gate"
      ],
      "agent": {
        "backend": "claude",
        "agent_key": "coding",
        "context_policy": "provided_context_only",
        "runtime_profile": "claude_print",
        "execution_mode": "claude_print",
        "poll_seconds": 30,
        "timeout_seconds": 3000,
        "artifact_transfer_mode": "inline",
        "result_text_limit": 18000,
        "prompt_payload_limit": 50000,
        "bare": true,
        "prompt": "你是 Python 核心实现工程师。首次执行时，请严格基于架构规格输出 `maos_cache.py` 的完整实现代码。若上游包含 `quality_review_gate` 的 `decision=needs_revision`，请必须逐条吸收其中的 `required_changes` 和 `reason`，输出修订后的完整 `maos_cache.py`，不要只输出 diff。要求代码可直接复制运行，使用标准库，包含类型注解。重点处理：TTL 过期清理、OrderedDict/LRU 淘汰、asyncio single-flight、同步与异步 wrapper、异常不缓存、clear/invalidate/cache_info。"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 3300
    },
    {
      "id": "test_engineer",
      "label": "测试用例设计与修订",
      "operation": "agent_task",
      "join": "any",
      "max_visits": 3,
      "deps": [
        "requirements_architect",
        "quality_review_gate"
      ],
      "agent": {
        "backend": "claude",
        "agent_key": "qa",
        "context_policy": "provided_context_only",
        "runtime_profile": "claude_print",
        "execution_mode": "claude_print",
        "poll_seconds": 30,
        "timeout_seconds": 2400,
        "artifact_transfer_mode": "inline",
        "result_text_limit": 14000,
        "prompt_payload_limit": 50000,
        "bare": true,
        "prompt": "你是 Python 测试工程师。首次执行时，请严格基于架构规格输出完整 pytest 测试文件。若上游包含 `quality_review_gate` 的 `decision=needs_revision`，请必须逐条吸收其中的 `required_changes` 和 `reason`，补充或修订测试，输出完整 `test_maos_cache.py`，不要只输出 diff。测试至少覆盖：cache hit/miss、TTL 过期、LRU 淘汰、invalidate/clear、异常不缓存、异步并发 single-flight 只执行一次、同步函数装饰器、异步函数装饰器、cache_info 统计。"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 2700
    },
    {
      "id": "quality_review_gate",
      "label": "质量审查门",
      "operation": "agent_task",
      "join": "all",
      "max_visits": 3,
      "deps": [
        "core_implementation",
        "test_engineer"
      ],
      "agent": {
        "backend": "claude",
        "agent_key": "reviewer",
        "context_policy": "provided_context_only",
        "runtime_profile": "claude_print",
        "execution_mode": "claude_print",
        "poll_seconds": 30,
        "timeout_seconds": 2400,
        "artifact_transfer_mode": "inline",
        "result_text_limit": 12000,
        "prompt_payload_limit": 70000,
        "bare": true,
        "prompt": "你是严格的 Python 代码质量审查门。请审查上游 `core_implementation` 和 `test_engineer` 是否已经满足架构规格和原始任务。重点检查：代码是否完整可运行；同步/异步装饰器是否都支持；TTL 与 LRU 是否正确组合；single-flight 是否真的避免同 key 并发重复执行；异常路径是否不缓存且清理 inflight；cache_info 是否准确；测试是否能覆盖关键边界。最终必须输出一个独立 JSON 对象，不要包在 markdown 代码块里，格式严格如下：{\"decision\":\"approved 或 needs_revision\",\"reason\":\"一句中文审查结论\",\"required_changes\":[\"需要修改的具体事项；通过时为空数组\"],\"confidence\":0.0}。只有当实现和测试都足够完整时才输出 approved；否则输出 needs_revision。"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 2700
    },
    {
      "id": "final_integrator",
      "label": "最终整合交付",
      "operation": "agent_task",
      "join": "any",
      "deps": [
        "requirements_architect",
        "core_implementation",
        "test_engineer",
        "quality_review_gate"
      ],
      "agent": {
        "backend": "claude",
        "agent_key": "coordinator",
        "context_policy": "provided_context_only",
        "runtime_profile": "claude_print",
        "execution_mode": "claude_print",
        "poll_seconds": 30,
        "timeout_seconds": 3600,
        "artifact_transfer_mode": "inline",
        "result_text_limit": 28000,
        "prompt_payload_limit": 90000,
        "bare": true,
        "prompt": "你是最终整合工程师。只有在上游 `quality_review_gate` 的 `decision=approved` 后才执行最终交付。请基于最新一轮实现、测试和审查结果，产出最终可交付版本：1) `maos_cache.py` 完整最终代码；2) `test_maos_cache.py` 完整 pytest 测试代码；3) 简短设计说明；4) 使用示例；5) 说明审查门最终通过的原因。代码块必须完整可复制，不要省略。"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 3900
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "requirements_architect",
      "to": "core_implementation",
      "label": "规格驱动实现"
    },
    {
      "from": "requirements_architect",
      "to": "test_engineer",
      "label": "规格驱动测试"
    },
    {
      "from": "core_implementation",
      "to": "quality_review_gate",
      "label": "提交实现审查"
    },
    {
      "from": "test_engineer",
      "to": "quality_review_gate",
      "label": "提交测试审查"
    },
    {
      "from": "quality_review_gate",
      "to": "core_implementation",
      "when": "last.decision == 'needs_revision'",
      "kind": "loop",
      "label": "审查未通过：回退实现修订"
    },
    {
      "from": "quality_review_gate",
      "to": "test_engineer",
      "when": "last.decision == 'needs_revision'",
      "kind": "loop",
      "label": "审查未通过：回退测试修订"
    },
    {
      "from": "quality_review_gate",
      "to": "final_integrator",
      "when": "last.decision == 'approved'",
      "kind": "branch",
      "label": "审查通过：最终整合"
    }
  ],
  "description": "带循环审查门的多 Agent 编码示例：实现与测试并行产出，审查门通过才最终汇总；否则根据审查意见回退到实现和测试节点重新修订，最多三轮。",
  "metadata": {
    "comparison_group": "coding_async_ttl_cache",
    "comparison_role": "multi_agent_review_loop",
    "backend_variant": "claude",
    "loop_policy": {
      "review_node": "quality_review_gate",
      "pass_decision": "approved",
      "retry_decision": "needs_revision",
      "max_review_visits": 3,
      "max_revision_visits": 3
    },
    "expected_advantage": [
      "用审查门显式阻止低质量实现直接进入最终交付",
      "实现节点和测试节点都能看到同一份审查意见并协同修订",
      "Web UI 可观察每轮审查 decision、reason 和 required_changes",
      "最终交付只使用最后一轮通过审查的实现与测试"
    ]
  }
}
